<section class="page-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="area-copy">
      <div class="area-rail"><p class="area-eyebrow">In short</p></div>
      <div class="area-body">
      <h2>A senior move manager explained</h2>
      <p>A senior move manager, also called a later-life move manager, is a professional who plans and coordinates a move for an older person. Instead of arranging a removals firm, a cleaner, an estate agent and a packing team separately, you work with one person who looks after the whole process.</p>
      <p>The role is practical, not medical, legal or financial: a senior move manager does not give care advice, legal advice or financial advice, and is not an estate agent.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-section grey">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="smm-head"><p class="area-eyebrow">What they do</p><h2>What a senior move manager typically does</h2></div>
    <div class="area-pkg-grid smm-grid">
      <div class="area-pkg-card"><span class="num">1</span><p>Plans the move with you: where, when, what will fit and what it will cost.</p></div>
      <div class="area-pkg-card"><span class="num">2</span><p>Helps sort and declutter at your pace, with decisions staying with you.</p></div>
      <div class="area-pkg-card"><span class="num">3</span><p>Arranges or carries out packing, and books a fully insured removal.</p></div>
      <div class="area-pkg-card"><span class="num">4</span><p>Works alongside your estate agent and solicitor so dates and paperwork line up.</p></div>
      <div class="area-pkg-card"><span class="num">5</span><p>Arranges cleaning, utilities and storage where needed.</p></div>
      <div class="area-pkg-card"><span class="num">6</span><p>Unpacks, sets up the new home and checks you are settled.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="smm-head"><p class="area-eyebrow">Comparison</p><h2>How it differs from other services</h2></div>
    <div class="area-pkg-grid smm-grid smm-grid-2">
      <div class="area-pkg-card"><h4>Removals company</h4><p>A removals company moves belongings on the day. See <a href="/about-chayce/">Chayce compared with a standard removals company</a>.</p></div>
      <div class="area-pkg-card"><h4>Estate agent</h4><p>An estate agent sells or lets property. A senior move manager does not sell property.</p></div>
      <div class="area-pkg-card"><h4>House-clearance firm</h4><p>A house-clearance firm empties a property. A senior move manager helps you decide what to keep, sell, donate or let go, and nothing goes without your agreement.</p></div>
      <div class="area-pkg-card"><h4>Financial or legal adviser</h4><p>A financial or legal adviser gives regulated advice. A senior move manager does not.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-section grey">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="smm-head"><p class="area-eyebrow">When it helps</p><h2>When a senior move manager is worth considering</h2></div>
    <div class="smm-panel"><ul class="smm-ticks">
        <li>You are leaving a family home you have lived in for many years.</li>
        <li>You live far from family, or you are arranging a parent's move from a distance.</li>
        <li>The sale or purchase has tight dates and the packing cannot wait.</li>
        <li>You are moving to a bungalow, retirement apartment or <a href="/retirement-village-moving-service/">retirement village</a> with limited space.</li>
        <li>You want one person to deal with instead of several companies.</li>
    </ul></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="smm-head"><p class="area-eyebrow">Choosing one</p><h2>Questions to ask before you choose</h2></div>
    <div class="smm-panel"><ul class="smm-ticks smm-q">
        <li>Is the removal insured, and is the cover set out in writing?</li>
        <li>Is the quote fixed before the move begins?</li>
        <li>Is the team employed and vetted by the company, or subcontracted?</li>
        <li>Will I have one named contact throughout?</li>
        <li>Can I see a clear price list? Ours is on the <a href="/packages/">packages page</a>.</li>
        <li>Will I stay in control of every decision about my belongings?</li>
    </ul></div>
  </div>
</section>

